ta":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"}]},{"productId":690745,"name":"Disney Lorcana: Winterspell Illumineer's Trove Case","cleanName":"Disney Lorcana Winterspell Illumineers Trove Case","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/690745_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24500,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/690745/lorcana-tcg-winterspell-disney-lorcana-winterspell-illumineers-trove-case","modifiedOn":"2026-04-20T15:49:19.857","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[]},{"productId":706382,"name":"Winterspell Lore Cards (Set of 9)","cleanName":"Winterspell Lore Cards Set of 9","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/706382_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24500,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/706382/lorcana-tcg-winterspell-winterspell-lore-cards-set-of-9","modifiedOn":"2026-07-16T19:55:04.407","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"}]},{"productId":706606,"name":"Winterspell Lore Card (1 of 9)","cleanName":"Winterspell Lore Card 1 of 9","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/706606_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24500,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/706606/lorcana-tcg-winterspell-winterspell-lore-card-1-of-9","modifiedOn":"2026-07-17T14:43:48.093","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"<em>Dear Martin,\r\n<br>Hi, friend. I'm just checking in to make sure everything is okay. The snowstorm hit the Great Illuminary hard, and I'm stuck until a thaw comes—if one comes at all. Do you have any idea what happened? I hope you get this. Archimedes promised he'd deliver it, but it's pretty cold out there, even for a glimmer.\r\n<br>Yours,\r\n<br>Venturo</em>"}]},{"productId":706900,"name":"Winterspell Lore Card (2 of 9)","cleanName":"Winterspell Lore Card 2 of 9","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/706900_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24500,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/706900/lorcana-tcg-winterspell-winterspell-lore-card-2-of-9","modifiedOn":"2026-07-17T14:46:39.667","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"<em>Hey Venturo,\r\n<br>Am I okay? I'm more than okay, I'm having a BLAST! A huge snowball fight broke out in the town square and it seems like every glimmer in Lorcana is part of the action. Stitch got his tongue stuck to a window and was pelted with snowballs. Any word from Shanzay? I haven't seen her since the storm hit.\r\n<br>\"Warmly,\"\r\n<br>Martin</em>"}]},{"productId":706917,"name":"Winterspell Lore Card (3 of 9)","cleanName":"Winterspell Lore Card 3 of 9","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/706917_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24500,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/706917/lorcana-tcg-winterspell-winterspell-lore-card-3-of-9","modifiedOn":"2026-07-17T14:49:57.7","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"<em>Shanzay,\r\n<br>I hope Tinker Bell gets this message to you. She seemed confident that she could. If I don't hear from your soon, I'm going to organize a glimmer rescue party. This snow is no joke!\r\n<br>Your hero,\r\n<br>Martin\r\n<br>P.S. You gotta try Mrs. Cratchit's pudding. It's plum-azing!</em>"}]},{"productId":706935,"name":"Winterspell Lore Card (4 of 9)","cleanName":"Winterspell Lore Card 4 of 9","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/706935_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24500,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/706935/lorcana-tcg-winterspell-winterspell-lore-card-4-of-9","modifiedOn":"2026-07-17T15:10:03.063","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"<em>Hi Martin,\r\n<br>I got lost in the blizzard, but Tink found me and we took refuge in a cave. I made it back to the Beast's castle to warm up with her and the other glimmers there before heading back out. Plum pudding, you say? I'll be right there!\r\n<br>—Shanzay</em>"}]},{"productId":706936,"name":"Winterspell Lore Card (5 of 9)","cleanName":"Winterspell Lore Card 5 of 9","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/706936_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24500,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/706936/lorcana-tcg-winterspell-winterspell-lore-card-5-of-9","modifiedOn":"2026-07-17T15:14:50.343","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"<em>Dear Shanzay,\r\n<br>I'm worried. I think my Elsa glimmer is missing. I've also noticed a strange phenomenon. All the icicles in the trees seem to point in the same horizontal direction. I wonder if they point toward the same thing. Can you go investigate?\r\n<br>Be Safe,\r\n<br>Venturo</em>"}]},{"productId":706937,"name":"Winterspell Lore Card (6 of 9)","cleanName":"Winterspell Lore Card 6 of 9","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/706937_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24500,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/706937/lorcana-tcg-winterspell-winterspell-lore-card-6-of-9","modifiedOn":"2026-07-17T15:18:45.71","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"<em>Dear Venturo,\r\n<br>Get this! The icicles look like they point in the same direction, but they actually all point AWAY from a specific location. My Anna glimmer and I checked it out and found an enormous frozen vine there. And when she heard Elsa was missing, Anna took off to find her before I could do anything. You're still in the Illuminary, right? She's heading your way now.\r\n<br>—Shanzay</em>"}]},{"productId":706938,"name":"Winterspell Lore Card (7 of 9)","cleanName":"Winterspell Lore Card 7 of 9","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/706938_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24500,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/706938/lorcana-tcg-winterspell-winterspell-lore-card-7-of-9","modifiedOn":"2026-07-17T15:21:19.43","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"<em>Dear Shanzay,\r\n<br>I left the Illuminary. I would have stayed, but it got so strangely cold all of the sudden—colder than when the storm first hit. I'm enjoying a bowl of Mrs. Cratchit's soup at the moment. (You need to try it!) Before I left, I saw that Anna had arrived to look for Elsa. I hope she finds her...\r\n<br>Best,\r\n<br>Venturo</em>"}]},{"productId":706939,"name":"Winterspell Lore Card (8 of 9)","cleanName":"Winterspell Lore Card 8 of 9","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/706939_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24500,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/706939/lorcana-tcg-winterspell-winterspell-lore-card-8-of-9","modifiedOn":"2026-07-17T15:25:05.09","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"<em>Shanzay,\r\n<br>Venturo told me about the frozen vine and how it might have a connection to this winter storm. Between snowball battles, I've been asking around to see if anyone knows where it came from. Did someone inkcast it? Do you recognize it? There are a lot of rumors going around about where the storm came from, but it seems clear that the vine is at the center of all this.\r\n<br>Quizzically,\r\n<br>Martin</em>"}]},{"productId":706944,"name":"Winterspell Lore Card (9 of 9)","cleanName":"Winterspell Lore Card 9 of 9","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/706944_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24500,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/706944/lorcana-tcg-winterspell-winterspell-lore-card-9-of-9","modifiedOn":"2026-07-17T15:28:53.82","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"<em>Martin,\r\n<br>You may be right about the vine. I heard back from Anna at the Illuminary. She discovered that Elsa had sealed herself away there, fearful of her own power. Could Elsa have played a role in this sudden magical storm? Did she try to freeze the vine? If she did, why? And what happened that made her so afraid? I have so many questions. Most importantly, did you save me some pudding?\r\n<br>Hungrily,\r\n<br>Shanzay</em>"}]}]}